  "readmeFile": "Readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Destructive update:\n            1. '**PropertiesWithDefaultValuesAttribute' was renamed and replaced the old '**PropertiesAttribute'\n                (the original name was too long and inconvenient to use).\n            \n            Feature improvement update:\n            1. Added some 'Creat**' methods which only need to pass in generic parameter \n                to automatically use the associated fields to create model object.\n            2. Added some 'ModifyTo**' methods which only need to pass in existing object\n                to automatically use the associated fields to modify it.\n            3. In previous versions, \n                the code for analysis to collect information needed for generation and \n                the code for diagnostics had many similarities, now the two have been integrated together.\n            4. Supports using attributes by specifying property equal to value like 'Property = value'.\n            5. If at least one '**FieldDefaultValuesAttribute' is used, \n                other fields without specified default value will also be registered use the preset value.",
